+    $queueForFunctionsClone = new Func($publisherFunctions);
+    $queueForWebhooksClone = new Webhook($publisherWebhooks);
+    $queueForRealtimeClone = new Realtime();
```

Then update the listener registration to use the cloned versions explicitly.
